Subject: [PATCH 15/39] crfpmoc: Wait for fingerprint MKBP events during enroll
 and verify

Replace the immediate state machine advance in ENROLL_WAIT_FINGER
and VERIFY_WAIT_FINGER with actual event polling via
crfpmoc_cmd_wait_event_fingerprint. This function sets the
event mask with an ioctl, polls for POLLIN, and reads the
MKBP event, retrying on timeout.

Drop the ioctl retry-on-ETIMEDOUT in crfpmoc_ec_command since
timeouts are now handled at the event-wait layer instead.
