From 8a05b014670cc1dadc3d7c4792a56dd20fdb0fdc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mevans <mevans@isilon.com>
Date: Thu, 22 May 2025 16:39:24 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 23/39] crfpmoc: Clear device state before verify/identify
 template upload
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Reset the sensor via the clear-storage SSM before uploading templates
during verify and identify, ensuring a clean device state for
template matching. Chain the verify SSM after the clear completes.

Co-Authored-By: Marco Trevisan (Treviño) <mail@3v1n0.net>
---
 libfprint/drivers/crfpmoc/crfpmoc.c | 131 +++++++++++++++++++++++-----
 libfprint/drivers/crfpmoc/crfpmoc.h |  36 ++++++--
 tests/crfpmoc/custom.ioctl          | 120 +++++++++++++++++++++----
 3 files changed, 239 insertions(+), 48 deletions(-)

